# No Dead Code

- No commented-out provider blocks, stub classes, or orphaned widgets.
- Remove unused imports, exports, and dependencies when refactoring.
- If code is "for later", track it in Jira/beads — do not leave it in the tree.
- Delete scaffold files (e.g. unused `DioClient` wrappers) once the real implementation ships.
